---
source: crates/pith-cli/tests/help.rs
expression: "help(&[\"graph\"])?"
---
Inspect entry selection, action plans, and recorded dependencies

Usage: pith graph [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  select  Show which rule serves the entry's request
  plan    Derive the first action contract without executing it
  deps    Show the last attempt's recorded dependency subtree
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --output <OUTPUT>  Output shape. Defaults to pretty on a TTY, plain otherwise [possible values: pretty, plain, json]
      --store <DIR>      Content store root. Defaults to $PITH_HOME/store [env: PITH_STORE=]
      --state <FILE>     Engine state root. Defaults to $PITH_HOME/state.db [env: PITH_STATE=]
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
